 450               /       3.      IF AN ERROR DECLARED BY THE SPOOLER IT MAY BE RESET     /
 451               /               TO 0000 (IF QUEUE IS EMPTY) ELSE 0001 (PRRSST)          /
 452               /       4.      IF AN ERROR FROM PRINTER THEN IT MAY BE RESET IF THE    /
 453               /               PRINTER REPORTS NO ERROR ANYMORE (PRESET)               /
