 638               /IF THE STOP FLAG IS SET, THE STOP OVERLAY IS INVOKED.  WHEN THE STOP
 639               /OVERLAY COMPLETES, CONTROL RETURNS TO PRLOOP IF PRINTING IS TO CONTINUE.
 640               /OTHERWISE, CONTROL REMAINS ELSEWHERE AND THE LOOP IS TERMINATED.
