1232               /               TC IS THE ASCII POSITION IN THAT G SET                  /A193
1233               /       3.      TECHNICAL CHR DEADED WITH NORMAL CHR                    /A193
1234               /                               SD-SP-DG-TC-CH-CH .. ED                 /A193
1235               /               IN THIS CASE, CH'S ARE NORMAL CHARACTERS WHICH          /A193
1236               /               HAVE BEEN DEADED IN TO THE TECHNICAL CHARACTER          /A193
1237               /               CHARACTERS WHICH HAVE BEEN DEADED INTO THE TECH CHR     /A193
