1665               /       CKMOVE--CHECK VERTICAL MOVEMENT FOR PAGE OVERFLOW               /
1666               /               IF AUTO-PAGINATION IS NOT IN EFFECT WRAP IF             /
1667               /               NECESSARY SO THAT VERTICAL POSITION IS ALWAYS           /
1668               /               WITHIN CURRENT PAGE                                     /
