1670               /                                                                       /
1671               /               THE ROUTINE IS CALLED WITH A VALUE IN THE AC.           /
1672               /               THIS VALUE IS COMPARED TO THE PAGE SIZE                 /
1673               /               IF IT EXCEEDS THE PAGE SIZE, THE PAGE SIZE IS           /
1674               /               SUBTRACTED FROM IT AND A NEW VALUE IS RETURNED          /
1675               /               OTHERWISE, THE ORIGINAL VALUE IS RETURNED               /
1676               /                                                                       /
1677               /***********************************************************************/
