1725               
1726 002543  1040          TAD     PLDIR   /THERE IS ROOM FOR NEXT TIME--MOVE THE POINTER
1727 002544  1036          TAD     PLPTR
1728 002545  3036          DCA     PLPTR
1729               
1730 002546  2335          ISZ     PLNXT   /INCREMENT THE RETURN LOCATION
1731 002547  5735          JMP I   PLNXT   /AND RETURN
