2136 003201  1013          TAD     PREST1          / GET HIT COUNT
2137 003202  7510          SPA                     / IF POSITIVE CONTINUE,                 /A060
2138 003203  5247          JMP     DSABL           /  ELSE DISABLE HAMMAR FOR TW PASS      /A060
2139 003204  1776          TAD     PRQOVP          / CANCEL DARKNESS COMPONENT
2140 003205  3775          DCA     ESCT1           / ESCT1 = BOLD BIT (AC11)
2141               /
