2331               / FLABUZ will do 1 of 3 things to top middle of menu pages:
2332               /       1. Display "PRINTER STOPPED" when PRSTTS indicates a
2333               /       printer stop condition (PRSTTS greater than 1).
2334               /        (will buzz on 1st pass).
2335               /
2336               /       2.Display "PRINTER BUSY" when status word PRSTTS
2337               /       indicates printing (is 0001).
2338               /
2339               /       3.Blank out previous message when printer 1st changes
2340               /       to idle. (PRSTTS=0)
2341               
2342               / AND ONLY one thing when called from the editor:                       /M171
2343               /       The FIRST time that a STOPPED condition is detected the PRINTER /M141
2344               /       STOPPED message will be displayed and the buzzer shall buzz.    /M141
