2666               /       PTSTST--TEST FOR STOP.  IF THE USER WANTS TO STOP WE INVOKE     /
2667               /               THE STOP OVERLAYS.  THIS ROUTINE SHOULD ONLY BE CALLED  /
2668               /               WHEN WE ARE PROCESSING A CONTROL STATEMENT (WHICH BY    /
2669               /               DEFINITION CAN OCCUR ONLY BETWEEN LINES).  THE STOP     /
2670               /               OVERLAYS ARE OF TYPE OVTYPE=OLC.  ALL OTHER TYPE C      /
2671               /               OVERLAYS MUST BE CAPABLE OF BEING OVERLAYED BY THE      /
2672               /               STOP CODE WHICH THIS ROUTINE MAY INVOKE                 /
2673               /                                                                       /
2674               /***********************************************************************/
