2767               /FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION:        USER1 and USER2                         /A021
2768               /       The USER1 and USER2 routines turn on or off the character       /A021
2769               /       attributes of the video display controller, to enable the user  /A021
2770               /       to see attributed text (bolded, underlined, bolded & underlined)/A021
2771               /       as it will appear in a printed document.                        /A021
2772               /                                                                       /A021
2773               /  USER1 and USER2 PSEUDO-CODE                                          /A021
2774               /                                                                       /A021
